{
"markdown": "### QuickCC2\n\nLong-press Wi-Fi or Bluetooth in Control Center to pick a network or device and connect, without expanding the connectivity module.\n\nNetworks that are not saved and need a password open the Settings app.\n\nQuickCC2 is a new version of QuickCC, rewritten for iOS 15 to 26. It replaces QuickCC and cannot be installed together with QuickCC, RealCC or CCOnAndOff.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://cydia.ichitaso.com/depiction/quickcc2/QuickCC2_01.png",
"accessibilityText": "Wi-Fi"
},
{
"url": "https://cydia.ichitaso.com/depiction/quickcc2/QuickCC2_02.png",
"accessibilityText": "Bluetooth"
},
{
"url": "https://cydia.ichitaso.com/depiction/quickcc2/QuickCC2_03.png",
"accessibilityText": "Settings"
},
{
"url": "https://cydia.ichitaso.com/depiction/quickcc2/QuickCC2_04.png",
"accessibilityText": "Settings (continued)"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Wi-Fi List:** Shows signal strength and lock icons; tap to join saved and open networks.\n- **Bluetooth List:** Lists paired devices; tap to connect or disconnect.\n- **Quick Refresh:** Pull down to refresh the list.\n- **Stock Menu Preserved:** The expanded connectivity module keeps the stock menu.\n- **iPad Support:** Works with the small Bluetooth icon on Wi-Fi-only iPads (iOS 18 or later).\n- **Jade Compatible:** Works with Jade's Control Center.\n- **Turn Off Completely:** Optionally turn Wi-Fi / Bluetooth off completely from Control Center instead of \"Disconnecting until tomorrow\" (like RealCC / CCOnOff).\n- **Safe When Locked:** Disabled while the device is locked with a passcode (Control Center behaves as stock).\n- **Multilingual:** Localized in 24 languages.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
